sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant B as Broker
  participant S as Server, a member of the group
  C->>B: OPEN · to the name interop<br/>its half A, its bound
  B->>S: the OPEN, to a single member
  S->>B: ACCEPT · to the client's inbox<br/>halves A and B
  B->>C: the ACCEPT
  C->>B: PING · sequence 2<br/>halves A and B
  B->>S: the PING, the third leg
  Note over S: the connection told<br/>to the router, its handle
  C->>B: DATA · a REQUEST
  B->>S: the DATA, inbox to inbox
  S->>B: DATA · its RESULT
  B->>C: the DATA
